# Antminer S9 — Buildroot 2025.02.x + Xilinx 2024.2 (linux/u-boot xlnx_rebase tags)
# Host: Ubuntu 22.04/24.04 (WSL2). HW: Vivado/Vitis 2024.2 on Windows or Linux.

BR2_arm=y
BR2_cortex_a9=y
BR2_ARM_ENABLE_NEON=y
BR2_ARM_ENABLE_VFP=y
BR2_PACKAGE_HOST_LINUX_HEADERS_CUSTOM_6_6=y
BR2_GLOBAL_PATCH_DIR="board/xilinx/patches"
BR2_DOWNLOAD_FORCE_CHECK_HASHES=y

BR2_TARGET_GENERIC_HOSTNAME="antminer-s9"
BR2_TARGET_GENERIC_ISSUE="Antminer S9 Buildroot (sample_s9)"
BR2_TARGET_GENERIC_ROOT_PASSWD="root"
BR2_SYSTEM_DHCP="eth0"
BR2_ROOTFS_DEVICE_CREATION_DYNAMIC_EUDEV=y
BR2_ROOTFS_OVERLAY="board/antminer-s9/rootfs_overlay"
BR2_ROOTFS_POST_BUILD_SCRIPT="board/antminer-s9/post-build.sh"
BR2_ROOTFS_POST_IMAGE_SCRIPT="board/antminer-s9/post-image.sh"

BR2_LINUX_KERNEL=y
BR2_LINUX_KERNEL_CUSTOM_TARBALL=y
BR2_LINUX_KERNEL_CUSTOM_TARBALL_LOCATION="$(call github,Xilinx,linux-xlnx,xlnx_rebase_v6.6_LTS_merge_6.6.70)/xlnx_rebase_v6.6_LTS_merge_6.6.70.tar.gz"
BR2_LINUX_KERNEL_DEFCONFIG="xilinx_zynq"
BR2_LINUX_KERNEL_DTS_SUPPORT=y
BR2_LINUX_KERNEL_CUSTOM_DTS_PATH="board/antminer-s9/zynq-antminer-s9.dts"
BR2_LINUX_KERNEL_UIMAGE=y
BR2_LINUX_KERNEL_UIMAGE_LOADADDR="0x8000"
BR2_LINUX_KERNEL_INSTALL_TARGET=y
BR2_LINUX_KERNEL_NEEDS_HOST_OPENSSL=y

BR2_PACKAGE_BUSYBOX_SHOW_OTHERS=y
BR2_PACKAGE_BASH=y
BR2_PACKAGE_DHCPCD=y
BR2_PACKAGE_ETHTOOL=y
BR2_PACKAGE_E2FSPROGS=y
BR2_PACKAGE_HTOP=y
BR2_PACKAGE_IPROUTE2=y
BR2_PACKAGE_IPUTILS=y
BR2_PACKAGE_OPENSSH=y
BR2_PACKAGE_PROCPS_NG=y

BR2_TARGET_ROOTFS_EXT2=y
BR2_TARGET_ROOTFS_EXT2_4=y
BR2_TARGET_ROOTFS_EXT2_SIZE="128M"

BR2_TARGET_UBOOT=y
BR2_TARGET_UBOOT_BUILD_SYSTEM_KCONFIG=y
BR2_TARGET_UBOOT_CUSTOM_TARBALL=y
BR2_TARGET_UBOOT_CUSTOM_TARBALL_LOCATION="$(call github,Xilinx,u-boot-xlnx,xlnx_rebase_v2024.01_2024.2)/xlnx_rebase_v2024.01_2024.2.tar.gz"
BR2_TARGET_UBOOT_PATCH="board/antminer-s9/uboot.patch"
BR2_TARGET_UBOOT_BOARD_DEFCONFIG="xilinx_zynq_virt"
BR2_TARGET_UBOOT_CUSTOM_MAKEOPTS="DEVICE_TREE=zynq-antminer-s9"
BR2_TARGET_UBOOT_NEEDS_DTC=y
BR2_TARGET_UBOOT_NEEDS_OPENSSL=y
BR2_TARGET_UBOOT_NEEDS_GNUTLS=y
BR2_TARGET_UBOOT_FORMAT_IMG=y
BR2_TARGET_UBOOT_BOOT_SCRIPT=y
BR2_TARGET_UBOOT_BOOT_SCRIPT_SOURCE="board/antminer-s9/uboot-boot-script.txt"

BR2_PACKAGE_HOST_DOSFSTOOLS=y
BR2_PACKAGE_HOST_GENIMAGE=y
BR2_PACKAGE_HOST_MTOOLS=y
